: Order</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200, 400, 404, 401</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Endpoint POST detail được triển khai; dùng cập nhật theo logic view.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Đơn hàng</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>DELETE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/orders/{id}/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bearer JWT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Path: id:int</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>204: empty</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>204, 404, 401</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Xóa/hủy đơn theo logic view.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Đơn hàng</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>POST</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/orders/temporary/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bearer JWT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>JSON: cart_items:[{id,quantity,price}], delivery_address?, shipping_method?, coupon_code?</text:p></table:table-cell><table