able-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>GET công khai; ghi Bearer JWT + admin</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Path: id:int; Body: các trường cần đổi trong status_code, status_name, description</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200: OrderStatus</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200, 400, 404, 401/403</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cập nhật một phần OrderStatus.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Trạng thái đơn</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>DELETE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/order-statuses/{id}/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>GET công khai; ghi Bearer JWT + admin</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Path: id:int</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>204: empty</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>204, 404, 401/403</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Xóa OrderStatus.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vận chuyển</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>GET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/shipping-methods/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bearer JWT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>—</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200: ShippingMethod[]</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200, 401</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Liệt kê phương thức vận chuyển; implementation hiện yêu cầu đăng nhập.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vận chuyển</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>POST</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/shipping-methods/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bearer JWT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>JSON: method_code, method_name, base_cost?, description, is_active?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>201: ShippingMethod</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>201, 400, 401</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tạo shipping method (implementation không kiểm tra admin).</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vận chuyển</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>GET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/shipping-methods/{id}/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bearer JWT + admin</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Path: id:int</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200: ShippingMethod</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200, 404, 401/403</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Lấy shipping method (admin).</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vận chuyển</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>PUT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/shipping-methods/{id}/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bearer JWT + admin</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Path: id:int; JSON: method_code, method_name, base_cost?, description, is_active?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200: ShippingMethod</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200, 400, 404, 401/403</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Cập nhật shipping method.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Vận chuyển</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>DELETE</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/shipping-methods/{id}/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bearer JWT + admin</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Path: id:int</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>204: empty</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>204, 404, 401/403</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Xóa shipping method.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Giao hàng</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>GET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/delivery-methods/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Không</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>—</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200: DeliveryMethod[] {id,name,description,code}</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Danh sách phương thức giao hàng.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Thanh toán</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>GET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/payment-methods/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Không</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>—</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200: PaymentMethod[]</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200, 500</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Danh sách payment method active.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Thanh toán</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>GET</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/payments/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bearer JWT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Query bắt buộc: order_id:int</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200: Payment[]</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200, 400, 401, 500</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Danh sách payment theo order_id; view không kiểm tra rõ quyền sở hữu order.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Thanh toán</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>POST</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/payments/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Bearer JWT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>JSON: order, status, method, transaction_id?, gateway_response?, amount, paid_at?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>201: Payment</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>201, 400, 401, 500</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Tạo payment cho order.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Thanh toán</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>POST</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/process-payment/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Không (callback VNPAY)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Payload/query callback VNPAY (vnp_*); xác thực chữ ký do service</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200: payload bổ sung paid_at,total_amount,description</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>200, 400, 404, 500</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Xử lý phản hồi VNPAY và cập nhật payment.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><table:table table:name="Schema"><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce1" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Schema</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce1" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Fields / quy ước</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>User</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id (RO), name, email, phone_number, password (write-only)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Supplier</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/slug (RO); company_name, contact_person, email, phone_number, address, tax_id, status, website, started_at</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Category</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/slug (RO); name, description, image_url, parent, subcategories (RO)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Product</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/slug/supplier_details/stock (RO); supplier, name, description, cost_price, price, sale_price, is_published (RO), publish_at, image_url, category_id (write-only)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>ProductVariant</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/details/timestamps (RO); product, size?, color?, sku, stock, image_url?, weight_grams, is_active</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>DeliveryAddress</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/user/timestamps (RO); recipient_name, is_default, name, province_city, district, ward_commune, specific_address, phone_number; *_details (RO)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>CartItem</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/variant_details/item_total_price/available_variants/timestamps (RO); variant (write-only), quantity</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Promotion</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/current_usage/applied_*_ids/timestamps (RO); name, description, type, value, start_date, end_date, max_discount_amount, min_order_amount, usage_limit, priority, is_active</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Coupon</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/current_usage (RO); code, description, type, value, min_order_amount, max_discount_amount, start_date, end_date, usage_limit_per_user, usage_limit_per_coupon, is_active</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Review</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/user/details/status/timestamps (RO); product (write-only), order (write-only), rating?, comment?</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Order</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/order_code/user/details/totals/timestamps/promotion/discount/selected_coupons/vnpay_payment_url/order_items (RO); delivery_address?, shipping_method?, payment_method?, current_status?, customer_note?, admin_note?</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Payment</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>id/timestamps/status_details/method_details (RO); order, status, method, transaction_id?, gateway_response?, amount, paid_at?</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><table:table table:name="Ghi chú"><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce1" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nội dung</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce1" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Giá trị</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Nguồn</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Đọc trực tiếp các URL, views và serializers trong backend/; không suy đoán từ frontend.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Base URL</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>JWT</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Các endpoint yêu cầu đăng nhập dùng IsAuthenticated; gửi Authorization: Bearer &lt;access_token&gt;. Login/refresh còn dùng cookies access/refresh.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>RO</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Read-only: trường chỉ có trong response hoặc do server tự gán.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Upload ảnh</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Category/Product khai báo MultiPartParser, FormParser và JSONParser; gửi multipart/form-data khi image_url là file.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Phạm vi</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>100 operation được expose trong urlpatterns. PaymentStatusListAPIView và OrderDeleteAPIView có code nhưng không có URL, nên không đưa vào endpoints.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Swagger</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string"><text:p>/api/v1/swagger/schema (giao diện Swagger UI theo core/urls.py).</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table></office:spreadsheet></office:body></office:document>